see her out and about like this.

251
00:17:17,680 --> 00:17:19,880
And now she's asleep? How funny!

252
00:17:20,000 --> 00:17:22,235
She's certainly got guts, doesn't she?

253
00:17:27,260 --> 00:17:28,560
Go ahead without me.

254
00:17:28,840 --> 00:17:30,157
You'll do great, Himari.

255
00:17:30,240 --> 00:17:31,122
Don't sweat it.

256
00:17:31,720 --> 00:17:34,097
Taking a bath before the exhibition match?

257
00:17:34,180 --> 00:17:36,415
You must be feeling awfully confident.

258
00:17:37,160 --> 00:17:40,395
I intend to be clean and
well-groomed when I win today.

259
00:17:40,880 --> 00:17:41,710
Oh, yeah?

260
00:17:41,793 --> 00:17:43,897
It sounds like you've got a plan in mind.

261
00:17:43,980 --> 00:17:47,360
But the question is, can
you actually pull it off?

262
00:17:55,840 --> 00:17:56,670
Of course!

263
00:17:56,900 --> 00:17:57,800
I know I can!

264
00:17:58,880 --> 00:18:00,998
Oh, you still haven't left the dorm?

265
00:18:01,360 --> 00:18:03,478
The match is supposed to start soon.

266
00:18:03,580 --> 00:18:05,698
You're only delaying the inevitable.

267
00:18:09,820 --> 00:18:10,857
It'll be okay.

268
00:18:10,940 --> 00:18:14,280
Hey, remember, we trained our asses off.

269
00:18:17,140 --> 00:18:19,500
Awfully cocky for a slave. What?

270
00:18:21,020 --> 00:18:24,100
Well, obviously, we're guaranteed to win.

271
00:18:29,880 --> 00:18:30,980
Hey, everyone.

272
00:18:31,360 --> 00:18:32,360
Sorry we're late.

273
00:18:33,060 --> 00:18:34,320
Write your name down.

274
00:18:34,660 --> 00:18:35,640
What's this for?

275
00:18:36,080 --> 00:18:38,660
It's used to trigger
Gina Beezin's ability.

276
00:18:39,300 --> 00:18:44,065
She can create a barrier by drawing a line
on the ground that acts as a boundary.

277
00:18:44,420 --> 00:18:47,397
Only those who sign their
names can enter the barrier.

278
00:18:47,480 --> 00:18:51,892
Also, any damage sustained during combat
inside the barrier will be healed.

279
00:18:52,240 --> 00:18:53,717
Thank you for your patience.

280
00:18:53,800 --> 00:18:56,560
My name's Gina Bizen of the 10th Squadron,

281
00:18:56,660 --> 00:19:00,307
and I'll be your rep for today's
Inner Squad Exhibition Match.

282
00:19:02,220 --> 00:19:03,050
Gina's Club!

283
00:19:11,060 --> 00:19:13,797
This ability of mine is
like a dream come true.

284
00:19:13,880 --> 00:19:17,217
I get to see the demon defense
force up close and personal.

285
00:19:17,300 --> 00:19:19,317
Not everyone believes
Peach's cramped power

286
00:19:19,400 --> 00:19:21,057
is based on the person's
nature and knowledge,

287
00:19:21,140 --> 00:19:22,140
but I totally do.

288
00:19:23,360 --> 00:19:26,497
This barrier could withstand
the force of a thousand Shuki.

289
00:19:26,580 --> 00:19:29,051
We're counting on you to judge this fight.

290
00:19:29,780 --> 00:19:31,900
Right, Lady Ten and Lady Kyo?

291
00:19:32,120 --> 00:19:33,860
I will do my best!

292
00:19:34,400 --> 00:19:35,400
Lady Kyo?

293
00:19:35,940 --> 00:19:37,764
Are you a fangirl or something?

294
00:19:37,880 --> 00:19:39,300
Huh? Oh, God.

295
00:19:39,520 --> 00:19:41,520
I really need to shut the hell up.

296
00:19:42,200 --> 00:19:43,920
All right, I'm all set!

297
00:19:45,100 --> 00:19:46,440
Uh, did you make that?

298
00:19:46,820 --> 00:19:50,817
Nei counts as a non-combatant, so
her job is to cheer on her teammates!

299
00:19:50,900 --> 00:19:52,500
First up in round one!

300
00:19:52,800 --> 00:19:57,700
Himari Azuma of the seventh squadron
versus Yachiho Azuma of the sixth squadron!

301
00:19:58,240 --> 00:20:01,946
The rules are whoever gives up
or gets knocked out first loses!

302
00:20:02,560 --> 00:20:04,977
Injuries will be healed,
so feel free to go nuts!

303
00:20:05,060 --> 00:20:09,140
As soon as I humiliate you, I'm
going to drag you back home.

304
00:20:09,480 --> 00:20:11,892
Then you'll be my special little servant.

305
00:20:19,200 --> 00:20:21,560
I'm not the same person I was back then.

306
00:20:22,260 --> 00:20:24,740
I will defeat you, Yachi-ho.

307
00:20:35,820 --> 00:20:38,980
As part of my ability,
he's going to assist me.

308
00:20:39,380 --> 00:20:40,360
Fine by me.

309
00:20:40,640 --> 00:20:43,717
Denying a dog handler her
pup is just plain heartless.

310
00:20:43,800 --> 00:20:45,120
Is everyone ready?

311
00:20:46,660 --> 00:20:50,380
Now let the first match begin!

312
00:20:51,220 --> 00:20:53,320
Don't say I didn't warn you.

313
00:20:53,480 --> 00:20:55,245
You won't last a second again.

314
00:20:58,540 --> 00:21:01,020
Where the hell did that come from?

315
00:21:02,900 --> 00:21:04,260
Um, golden hour!

316
00:21:05,180 --> 00:21:06,420
Rewind, five seconds!

317
00:21:12,080 --> 00:21:12,910
Beacon!

318
00:21:14,200 --> 00:21:15,120
She's tired.

319
00:21:15,420 --> 00:21:18,677
We planned ahead in case we couldn't
beat her with a single blow.

320
00:21:18,760 --> 00:21:20,407
Let's stick to our strategy.

321
00:21:21,020 --> 00:21:22,640
She changed tactics.

322
00:21:23,000 --> 00:21:25,765
Was it an accident or
did she do it on purpose?

323
00:21:26,060 --> 00:21:29,757
Oh, Himari, you haven't realized
my ability has gotten stronger.

324
00:21:29,840 --> 00:21:33,937
It's an indisputable fact that little
sisters can't beat big sisters.

325
00:21:34,020 --> 00:21:36,980
I'll prove it to you with prime time!

326
00:22:10,360 --> 00:22:13,160
Thank you.

327
00:22:29,840 --> 00:22:34,357
I got my heart, it's your
heart, it's your heart.

328
00:22:34,440 --> 00:22:37,617
I need one, two, three, two, one,!

329
00:22:37,700 --> 00:22:42,217
The sound of your heart, I'm
going to take a look at the heart.

330
00:22:42,300 --> 00:22:47,720
I'm going to take two,
I'm going to take one,!

331
00:22:48,420 --> 00:22:52,437
I'm going to take the
connection with the ring.

332
00:22:52,520 --> 00:22:53,657
Let me see what I'm doing.

333
00:22:53,740 --> 00:22:55,417
I'm going to be sad to be sad.

334
00:22:58,840 --> 00:23:02,397
I'll never be able to leave you forever.

335
00:23:02,480 --> 00:23:05,720
I'll never be able to leave you forever.

336
00:23:27,720 --> 00:23:29,857
or she can't switch out for
a different skill later.

337
00:23:29,940 --> 00:23:32,577
Every technique used
requires lots of studying.

338
00:23:32,660 --> 00:23:35,437
It's the perfect skill for
someone like Miss Himari.
